 "about": "Explicit API -> receiving-language SDK pairs, used when an API record has no client generator for the project's language (genlib find, quick, Jev and MCP). Each target is a catalog package published by the API's own vendor and is a client for that API, not a mobile UI SDK or a feature-flag evaluator. Kotlin pairs reuse the vendor's JVM library. 'providers' covers a whole provider only where one module truly serves every API (google.golang.org/api for Go). A missing pair means docs and the spec, never a guess. Validated by tests/api-install.test.mjs.",
